    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# [Ultimate] Flow C — Enhanced Watchdog\n\n## 4 大監控功能\n\n### C-1: Error Monitor\nError Trigger → Code 萃取 → Notion HTTP API 寫錯誤日誌 + LINE 推播\n\n### C-2: Nightly Reindex (00:00)\nNotion HTTP query status=NEW/FAILED → Execute Flow A → 回寫 REINDEXED\n\n### C-3: Weekly Quality Check (Sun 10:00)\n測試問句 → Compile Report → LINE 推播\n\n### C-4: Media Retry (06:00)\nNotion HTTP query status=MEDIA_FAILED → Execute Flow A → 回寫 RETRY_COMPLETE\n\n---\n**不使用 Notion node**，全部透過 HTTP API 操作，避免 schema 相容問題。\n\n**Placeholder 替換清單：**\n- YOUR_NOTION_TOKEN\n- YOUR_ERROR_LOG_DATA_SOURCE_ID\n- YOUR_INDEX_LOG_DATA_SOURCE_ID\n- LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN\n- ADMIN_LINE_USER_ID\n- FLOW_A_WORKFLOW_ID\n",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 1020
      },
      "id": "9cfd482a-9cc8-4c35-9d3a-1b630b75f8ef",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Phase 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -220
      ]
    }
